          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "569/0/10030 BIERTON WITH BROUGHTON BURCOTT LANE Barn at No.94 (Formerly listed as Barn at Burcott Lodge) 10-JUL-03 GV II Barn, probably dating from the late seventeenth century.  Timber frame, weatherboarded and with plain tile roof.  Four bays.  Timber trusses with tie-beams and queen struts, with rafters above.  Large opening set off-centre, with double doors, and further doors and half doors beyond.   Internal timber partitions to either side of the main entrance. Forms a group with the adjoining house, Burcott Lodge, to which it lies parallel. Listing NGR: SP8424115140"
    }
